Package: libksba
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libgpg-error (>= 1.61), libsystem
Description: X.509 and CMS library
 libksba parses and builds X.509 certificates, CRLs and CMS
 messages. GnuPG uses it for S/MIME and for certificates.

Package: libksba-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libksba (= ${binary:Version}), libgpg-error-dev (>= 1.61)
Description: X.509 and CMS library: development files
 The header, the pkg-config file and the autoconf macro for building
 programs against libksba.
